# SYRAVEN — repository attributes
#
# Added in Phase 2 (see IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md) to keep generated and SQL
# files in a consistent, tool-readable encoding.

# Treat all text files consistently, normalising line endings in the repo.
* text=auto

# Generated Supabase types.
#
# This file was previously committed as UTF-16LE, which is what
# `supabase gen types typescript ... > types/database.ts` produces when a
# PowerShell redirect is used on Windows. UTF-16 compiles fine but breaks
# grep, diffs and most tooling (ARCHITECTURE_AUDIT.md §9.2).
#
# Marking it as text keeps it diffable. When regenerating, write UTF-8
# explicitly, e.g.:
#
#   npx supabase gen types typescript --linked `
#     | Out-File -Encoding utf8 types/database.ts
#
# or from bash:
#
#   npx supabase gen types typescript --linked > types/database.ts
types/database.ts text eol=lf

# SQL migrations: keep LF so hashes are stable across platforms.
*.sql text eol=lf
